#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:12
msgid "Work with snaps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:14
msgid ""
"The snap system has been designed to look after itself with automatic "
"security and update policies. However, these elements, and many others, can "
"also be configured and managed manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:16
msgid ""
"{ref}`Manage updates <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-manage-updates>`: "
"Control when snaps update, or hold an update indefinitely ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:17
msgid ""
"{ref}`Connect interfaces <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-connect-"
"interfaces>`: Control exactly what a snap can access, and what it can't."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:18
msgid ""
"{ref}`Configure snaps <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-configure-snaps>`: "
"Learn how to set options for your servers and daemons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:19
msgid ""
"{ref}`Apps and aliases <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-apps-and-aliases>`: "
"Use your preferred names for your snapped applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:23
msgid ""
"Outside of whatever facilities a snapped application may provide, snaps also "
"provides data snapshots, usage quotas and control over if and when a service "
"runs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:25
msgid ""
"{ref}`Create data snapshots <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-create-data-"
"snapshots>`: Make a copy of a snap's user, system and configuration data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:26
msgid ""
"{ref}`Use quota resources <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-use-resource-quotas>`: "
"Set processor and memory resource limits on your snaps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:27
msgid ""
"{ref}`Disk space awareness <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-disk-space-"
"awareness>`: Check whether there's enough disk space before certain "
"operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:28
msgid ""
"{ref}`Set system options <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-set-system-options>`: "
"The main way to configure your snapped applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:29
msgid ""
"{ref}`Control services <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-control-services>`: "
"Start, stop and restart snapped background service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:30
msgid ""
"{ref}`Validation sets <explanation-how-snaps-work-validation-sets>`: Ensure "
"a defined set of snaps are installed and updated together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:31
msgid ""
"{ref}`Use the REST API <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-use-the-rest-api>`: Learn "
"how to access and use our REST API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:33
msgid "Problem solving"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:35
msgid ""
"The vast majority of snap users and developers experience very few issues, "
"but any technology this complex and diverse will likely encounter some "
"issues and incompatibilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:37
msgid ""
"{ref}`Fix common issues <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-index>`: If you do "
"run into problems, find common solutions here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:38
msgid ""
"{ref}`Test snapd fixes <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-test-snapd-fixes>`: "
"Run a bugfix build of the snap daemon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:39
msgid ""
"{ref}`Debug running snaps <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-debug-snaps>`: "
"Test bugfix releases of snapd."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:43
msgid ""
"Extend snap functionality with API access, internal tools, and customised "
"environments for your applications and devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:45
msgid ""
"{ref}`Use the REST API <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-use-the-rest-api>`: how "
"to access the SnapD REST API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:46
msgid ""
"{ref}`Use snapctl <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-use-snapctl>`: use the snapctl "
"tool within a snap application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:47
msgid ""
"{ref}`Test snapd fixes <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-test-snapd-fixes>`: "
"test out the latest release of the snap daemon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to-guides/index.md:48
msgid ""
"{ref}`Debug snaps <how-to-guides-fix-common-issues-debug-snaps>`: solve "
